#!RuleTest
#test DRAFT-900045 expect=skipped domain=DS
#note "Neither DSCAT nor DSSCAT is in the dataset: Requirements.Variables.All [DSCAT] is unsatisfied, so the sister skips naming DSCAT. Without the trigger column the sister cannot tell whether any record is a disposition event; DSCAT's own absence is a separate question this rule does not answer (the generic Expected-variable rules cover it)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DS class=EVENTS label="Disposition"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col DSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col EPOCH    type=Char label="Epoch"
---
S1 | DS | 001 | 1 | TREATMENT
